WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.091
Today we will present performance work as a team. Our work connects with other

00:00:05.091 --> 00:00:05.789
Ghanaian communities.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:09.731
Agree on the order of songs, dance or drama items.

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:13.625
Rehearse entry, performance and respectful exit.

00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:19.665
Present the item and thank the audience at the end. Compare your result with a second

00:00:19.665 --> 00:00:20.611
example from Ghana.
